{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_143_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_143","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春王三月，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_143_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_143","textTraditional":"二、晉侯使郤州來聘。己丑，及郤州盟。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_143_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_143","textTraditional":"三、夏，季孫行父如晉。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_143_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_143","textTraditional":"四、秋，叔孫僑如如齊。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_143_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_143","textTraditional":"五、冬十月。","sentenceOrder":5}],"overrides":{}}